    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Whenever the weather is nice, my daughters and I take a walk around the city. One recent Sunday, we set out from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Nanyuan Park",
            "zh": "南园公园"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Huangpu District."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When we reached the southern end of the park, we saw some boys pointing at the Huangpu River and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "shouting",
            "ref": "v-shout"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " happily. “What a big ship!” my younger daughter "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exclaimed",
            "ref": "v-exclaim"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " as she took a picture. “Where is it from?” my other girl asked. I looked closely at the ship. Its name, on its "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "stern",
            "zh": "船尾"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", is the Asian Spirit and it sails under the flag of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Liberia",
            "zh": "利比里亚"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “Shanghai has one of the world’s busiest "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ports",
            "ref": "v-port"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” I said to my daughters. “There are a lot of foreign friends here.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We walked on and took the ferry from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Huajing",
            "zh": "华泾"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Sanlin",
            "zh": "三林"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". My younger daughter was excited about the trip. It was her first time on a ferry."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The ferry station at Huajing has been rebuilt and looks modern. The one at Sanlin is still old. I took a picture of an old tree there. It was there the first time I took the ferry at Sanlin. I was with my mother. Now, I was with my daughters. The ships on the river come and go. So do the ferry passengers. Only the trees have stayed. "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "They"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " look at everything in silence. If they could speak, what stories would they tell?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We ended our walk at "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Qiantan",
            "zh": "前滩"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". My girls were tired, but they said they had had a good day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This summer, will you also take a walk around Shanghai? As you walk, you’ll see many interesting buildings, ships, trees, animals and people. You’ll have more fun than spending just another day looking at your phone."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
